T* (marketing patterns \(like those seen with 'InstantWealth.ai' and 'NovaX'\). This service would provide B2B clients with) Tj
T* (a \\"truth-layer\\" to avoid hype-driven investments and marketing campaigns, generating revenue through) Tj
T* (subscription or per-analysis fees.\\n\\n**5. Sri Lankan Leverage Insights:**\\n*   **Regional Asymmetry:** The) Tj
T* (Colombo Stock Exchange's undervalued energy sector, coupled with significant \\"whale\\" inflow, presents a unique) Tj
T* (regional asymmetry. This can be leveraged through AI-driven analysis to identify genuine opportunities versus) Tj
T* (potential manipulation.\\n*   **Data Arbitrage Hub:** Sri Lanka can strategically position itself as a hub for AI-driven) Tj
T* (data arbitrage. The current AI-to-AI trading of compute credits for local stock data is the nascent stage of this.) Tj
T* (Developing infrastructure and talent in this area can create a competitive global advantage.\\n\\n**6. 3–5 Year) Tj
